{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/extras/176ae7dd446ebd670b385856c67f3ac8.poster.avif?t=1769438263\" width=1170 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/extras/176ae7dd446ebd670b385856c67f3ac8.webm?t=1769438263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/extras/176ae7dd446ebd670b385856c67f3ac8.mp4?t=1769438263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Man Sitting is an over-the-top roguelite action shooter inspired by the \u201800s when FPS peaked. Pick your loadout, level up, draft Power Ups, and unlock new Chair upgrades while you grind through the workspace and survive against progressively harder waves of sentient office appliances in singleplayer or co-op multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/extras/bc0704db1772c1b9aa2cb9752438e4ed.poster.avif?t=1769438263\" width=1170 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/extras/bc0704db1772c1b9aa2cb9752438e4ed.webm?t=1769438263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/extras/bc0704db1772c1b9aa2cb9752438e4ed.mp4?t=1769438263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found an imba combo? Use it on your friends in the PvP arena mode! Shoot, hack, slash, grind, and draft your way to the top and any leaderboards.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrive under pressure: Experience intense skill-based grind-and-gun third person action and survive through waves of relentless bot onslaught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage challenging stakeholders: Take on different enemy types, from grunts to minibosses and finally major bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop a broader skillset: Gain XP to level up and draft from over 200 Power-Ups to unlock new synergies and builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position yourself for future opportunities: Customize your load-out with Chair Upgrades, different weapons and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP Strategic alignment sessions: Climb the ladder in the PvP arena mode where you can challenge your peers in a four-player king-of-the-hill tournament style</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/774291?t=1769438263","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/250881f2ef762f8c1563385ba86b132b8498030a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769438263","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/3f96b2ce4b4f1a6d2e8a5dc854a546a72bee2b7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769438263","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/3f96b2ce4b4f1a6d2e8a5dc854a546a72bee2b7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769438263","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/extras/176ae7dd446ebd670b385856c67f3ac8.poster.avif?t=1769438263\" width=1170 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/extras/176ae7dd446ebd670b385856c67f3ac8.webm?t=1769438263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/extras/176ae7dd446ebd670b385856c67f3ac8.mp4?t=1769438263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Man Sitting is an over-the-top roguelite action shooter inspired by the \u201800s when FPS peaked. Pick your loadout, level up, draft Power Ups, and unlock new Chair upgrades while you grind through the workspace and survive against progressively harder waves of sentient office appliances in singleplayer or co-op multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/extras/bc0704db1772c1b9aa2cb9752438e4ed.poster.avif?t=1769438263\" width=1170 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/extras/bc0704db1772c1b9aa2cb9752438e4ed.webm?t=1769438263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/extras/bc0704db1772c1b9aa2cb9752438e4ed.mp4?t=1769438263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found an imba combo? Use it on your friends in the PvP arena mode! Shoot, hack, slash, grind, and draft your way to the top and any leaderboards.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrive under pressure: Experience intense skill-based grind-and-gun third person action and survive through waves of relentless bot onslaught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage challenging stakeholders: Take on different enemy types, from grunts to minibosses and finally major bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop a broader skillset: Gain XP to level up and draft from over 200 Power-Ups to unlock new synergies and builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position yourself for future opportunities: Customize your load-out with Chair Upgrades, different weapons and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP Strategic alignment sessions: Climb the ladder in the PvP arena mode where you can challenge your peers in a four-player king-of-the-hill tournament style</p></li></ul>","developers":["DoubleMoose Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774291/5c05281696891c8cb3df8395efa376f39f9f8c09/header.jpg?t=1769438263","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Copyright 2025 Raw Fury AB. Developed by DoubleMoose. Published by Raw Fury AB. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.9 (Mavericks)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 4.1 (GeForce 600 or higher, AMD Radeon 5000 or higher, Intel HD 4000 or higher)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> One that makes sound</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.9 (Mavericks)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 4.1 (GeForce 660 or higher, AMD Radeon 7000 or higher)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> One that makes even better sound</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/774291/1268206439/a6334e928018c257cc7f499fb0e83e264aabba41/1768428226/dash_av1.mpd?t=17